                                                   <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology> .


###  https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000619
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000619> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000202> ,
                                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                     owl:onProperty <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001869> ;
                                                                     owl:someValuesFrom <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000225>
                                                                   ] ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Week"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Temporal Interval that is equal to seven consecutive Days."@en ;
